#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:73
msgid ""
"``argsort`` always returns ``uint16``; the array being sorted must therefore"
" have no more than 65,535 elements on the sorted axis."
msgstr ""
"``argsort`` selalu mengembalikan ``uint16``\\ ; array yang diurutkan karena "
"itu tidak boleh memiliki lebih dari 65.535 elemen pada sumbu yang diurutkan."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:77
msgid ""
":func:`~numpy.bincount` counts occurrences of each non-negative integer in a"
" 1-D ``uint8`` / ``uint16`` input::"
msgstr ""
":func:`~numpy.bincount` menghitung kemunculan setiap integer non-negatif "
"dalam input ``uint8`` / ``uint16`` 1-D::"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:84
msgid ""
"Useful for building histograms of small-integer pixel values without writing"
" a Python loop."
msgstr ""
"Berguna untuk membangun histogram dari nilai piksel integer kecil tanpa "
"menulis loop Python."

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:88
msgid "Sorting and reordering"
msgstr "Pengurutan dan penataan ulang"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/numpy/math/selection.rst:90
msgid ""
":func:`~numpy.sort` returns a sorted copy of the array along the given axis "
